{"id":7829,"path":"/grammar-points/b1/review-verb-tenses-b1/","parentId":341,"order":115,"section":"grammar-points","level":"b1","depth":3,"title":"Review of all intermediate verb tenses (CEFR B1)","seo":{"title":"Review of all intermediate verb tenses (CEFR B1) - Test-English","description":"Review all B1 verb tenses in this B1 Intermediate grammar lesson. Clear rules, grammar charts and exercises. Practise now!","image":"/media/uploads/B1%E2%80%93Verb-tense-review_B1.png"},"modified":"2026-02-28T09:27:16","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>Exercise 1</h3> <h5>Choose the correct verb tenses to complete the sentences below.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"575\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 2</h3> <h5>Choose the correct verb tenses to complete the sentences below.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"574\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 3</h3> <h5>Complete the sentences below with the verbs in brackets in the correct form: present simple or continuous, past simple or continuous, present perfect simple or continuous, past perfect, <em>shall</em>, <em>will</em> or <em>be going to</em>.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"576\"></div>"],"explanation":"<h3>Review of the present simple and the present continuous</h3> <p><img src=\"/media/uploads/Review-Present-simple-Present-continuous-B1-gramar-chart.png\" alt=\"Grammar chart for B1 level reviewing the present simple and present continuous tenses, showing usage rules, time adverbs, example sentences, and a list of non-action verbs.\" width=\"500\" height=\"930\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-29769\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h3>Review of the present perfect simple and the present perfect continuous</h3> <p><img src=\"/media/uploads/Review-Present-perfect-simple-and-continuous-B1-gramar-chart.png\" alt=\"Educational chart detailing the use of the present perfect simple and continuous tenses, with explanations, time expressions, and example sentences for B1 level English grammar review.\" width=\"500\" height=\"795\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-29768\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h3>Review of the past simple, past continuous, and past perfect</h3> <p><img src=\"/media/uploads/Review-Past-simple-continuous-and-perfect-B1-gramar-chart.png\" alt=\"Grammar chart for B1 level outlining the past simple, past continuous, and past perfect tenses with time expressions and example sentences for each tense.\" width=\"500\" height=\"970\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-29771\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h3>Review of all B1 future verb forms</h3> <p><img src=\"/media/uploads/Review-Future-verb-forms-B1-gramar-chart.png\" alt=\"B1 level grammar chart summarizing future forms in English, including the use of 'will', 'be going to', present continuous, and present simple for future events, with examples and use cases.\" width=\"500\" height=\"912\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-29766\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>","quizzes":[{"id":575,"questions":[{"id":4911,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I _____ anything about the night of the accident.</div>","choices":[{"id":7537,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>don't remember</span>"},{"id":7538,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>'m not remembering</span>"},{"id":7539,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>wasn't remembering</span>"}]},{"id":4914,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>After we broke up, she sold the ring that I _____ her for her birthday. </div>","choices":[{"id":7546,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>give</span>"},{"id":7547,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>was giving</span>"},{"id":7548,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>had given</span>"}]},{"id":4912,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>We _____ our website. </div>","choices":[{"id":7540,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>recently renewed</span>"},{"id":7541,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>are recently renewing</span>"},{"id":7542,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>have recently renewed</span>"}]},{"id":4915,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>We took off our clothes and _____ into the river. </div>","choices":[{"id":7549,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>were jumping</span>"},{"id":7550,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>had jumped</span>"},{"id":7551,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>jumped</span>"}]},{"id":4913,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>A: You look fitter! B: Yes, I _____ at the gym for the last few months. </div>","choices":[{"id":7543,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>'m working out</span>"},{"id":7544,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>'ve been working out</span>"},{"id":7545,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>work out</span>"}]},{"id":4916,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I'm pretty sure printed books _____ one day. </div>","choices":[{"id":7552,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>are disappearing</span>"},{"id":7553,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>are going to disappear</span>"},{"id":7554,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>will disappear</span>"}]},{"id":4917,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Look at the traffic. We _____ late. </div>","choices":[{"id":7555,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>are going to be</span>"},{"id":7556,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>will be</span>"},{"id":7557,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>are being</span>"}]},{"id":4918,"num":"8","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>____ your room yet?</div>","choices":[{"id":7558,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Have you tidied up</span>"},{"id":7559,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Did you tidy</span>"},{"id":7560,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Do you tidy up</span>"}]},{"id":4919,"num":"9","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I looked in the rearview mirror and saw that someone _____ us.</div>","choices":[{"id":7561,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>followed</span>"},{"id":7562,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>was following</span>"},{"id":7563,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>had followed</span>"}]},{"id":4920,"num":"10","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I'm unemployed and I _____ for a job. Tomorrow I have my third interview. </div>","choices":[{"id":7564,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>'m looking</span>"},{"id":7565,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>'ve looked</span>"},{"id":7566,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>look</span>"}]}]},{"id":574,"questions":[{"id":4900,"num":"1"