ou passing","Will you pass"]}]}]},{"id":576,"questions":[{"id":4921,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span class=\"tabtext\">A: Don’t go outside. It <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (rain) a lot now. You <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> (get) wet!</span><br><span class=\"tab\">B: Oh. I <span data-gap=\"2\"></span> (take) an umbrella then.</span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4922,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span class=\"tabtext\">A: Can you give me that knife?</span><br><span class=\"tab\">B: What <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (do) with it?</span><br><span class=\"tab\">A: I <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> (cut) a piece of pizza. I'm hungry. Do you want some?</span><br><span class=\"tab\">B: No, thanks, I'm not hungry; I <span data-gap=\"2\"></span> (just/eat) a sandwich.</span> </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4923,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span class=\"tabtext\">POLICE OFFICER: What <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (do) at the time the victim died?</span><br><span class=\"tab\">SUSPECT: I <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> (have) dinner with my old school friends. We were very excited because we <span data-gap=\"2\"></span> (see) each other for a long time.</span> </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4924,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span class=\"tabtext\">A: <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (you/go) to the concert next week?</span><br><span class=\"tab\">B: Yes, I <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> (already/buy) the tickets!</span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4925,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span class=\"tabtext\">A: <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (ever/be) to an ACDC concert?</span><br><span class=\"tab\">B: Yes, I <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> (go) to their concert in Berlin last year.</span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4926,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span class=\"tabtext\">A: I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (cook) all morning. I'm really tired.</span><br> <span class=\"tab\">B: Don't worry, I <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> (help) you finish.</span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4927,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span class=\"tabtext\">A: Why <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (drink) tea today? You <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> (never/drink) tea.</span><br><span class=\"tab\">B: Because I <span data-gap=\"2\"></span> (drink) too many cups of coffee yesterday.</span> </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4928,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span class=\"tabtext\">A: How long <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (we/drive)?</span><br><span class=\"tab\">B: Too long. I'm tired. <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> (we/stop) for coffee?</span><br><span class=\"tab\">A: OK.</span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}